      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "像这样以蓝靛果果汁对彼此起誓后，\n我和北港火山相处的日子开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c667775261e4f8f11a40787e925ad1dc3162eda547f1bf7f5530fbe848f3fe6c",
