      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为难得训练员千里迢迢来到苫小牧，\n我想介绍好吃的店家给你──",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a8404cc54d0ed30326ee59887563e4cb9bd12be1e09a7d256007f836854e22",
